Equipment Schedule: Halbray Field Solar Site 3 (PXA-2024-0002)
Tamsworth Electrical Constructors Inc. · Alleron Electrical Contractor Lic. #EC-11847
Drawing E-201 Rev B, 06/20/2025. A 2.3 MW community solar facility: four inverter skids (575 kW ac each, 2300 kW in all) on an 800 V ac collection system to switchboard CSB-1, step-up transformer T-1 and the 13.2 kV point of interconnection on feeder ALN-159.
Prepared: R. Vance, Electrical Engineer, Tamsworth Electrical Constructors Inc., 06/20/2025.
